Sam Ortiz opened a small bike shop on Mill Road three years ago. At first he only repaired old bikes, but now he also sells second-hand ones. Most of his customers are students from the college nearby. A simple repair takes about one hour, and Sam always explains what he has done. On Saturdays he runs a free class where people learn to fix a flat tyre. The shop is closed on Sundays.', 'VALID');
