-- Course test: a short text and a short announcement.

Riverside Market opens every Saturday from eight in the morning until two in the afternoon. About forty stalls sell fresh fruit, bread, cheese and flowers. Most of the sellers are local farmers. Visitors can park for free in the car park behind the church. In winter, the market moves inside the old town hall.', 'VALID');
